</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><div class="first-fold-wrap">
  <section class="section-content read-more-cont" id="two-wheelar-ins">
    <div class="il-container">
      <div class="img-cont-sec">
        <div class="cont-sec">
          <h2 class="heading2 mb-20">Two-wheeler Insurance</h2>
          <p class="text">Two-wheeler insurance is your vehicle’s unseen superhero. It protects your bike or scooter against real-world villains like unexpected accidents, natural or man‑made calamities, theft, etc. It also protects you when you accidentally cause third-party damages and liabilities. That’s why choosing the best two-wheeler insurance policy helps to ensure your every ride is safe, smooth and hassle-free. </p>

          <p class="text mt-30">Now that the GST on new bikes below 350 cc has been revised to just 18%, it has become quite affordable to buy a new bike. So when you bring a new ride to your home, safeguard it with ICICI Lombard’s two-wheeler insurance. Our policies are designed to give you complete peace of mind every time you hit the road.</p>

          <div id="what-tw" class="mt-40">
            <h2 class="heading2 heading2-title">What is Bike Insurance?</h2>
            <p class="text">Bike insurance or two-wheeler insurance is designed to give riders financial security and peace of mind every time they hit the road. It protects you against expenses from accidents, theft, and damage caused by natural or man-made disasters, while also covering expenses if your bike or scooter damages someone else’s vehicle or property. In unfortunate cases of injury or death, it provides compensation to ease the financial burden.</p>

            <p class="text mt-10 more-cont">Under the Motor Vehicles Act, every bike owner in India must carry at least a <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/third-party-bike-insurance" class="link">third-party bike insurance policy</a>, and riding without one can result in fines and penalties. Third-party coverage, however, does not cover own damages. For fuller protection, a comprehensive policy covers both your own bike and third-party damages, and you can enhance it further with add-ons such as zero depreciation, roadside assistance, or engine protection. With the right plan, every ride becomes safer, smoother, and worry-free.</p>

            <a href="javascript:;" class="r-more mt-20">Read more</a>   
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="img-sec">
          <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/what_is_bike_insurance.webp" width="399" alt="Two Wheeler Insurance - Security Round The Clock" title="Bike Insurance - Security Yourself Round The Clock" class="lazy tw-ins-img">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content quick-sum-block" id="quick-sum">
    <div class="il-container quick-block">
      <div class="flex-block">
        <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/ai-ico.webp" width="45" alt="Quick summary" title="Quick summary" class="lazy">
        <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Quick Summary</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="arrow-list mt-40">
        <ul class="list list2">
          <li class="list-item">
            <p class="text">Two-wheeler insurance provides financial protection against accidents, theft, fire, natural and man-made calamities, as well as third-party liabilities involving your bike or scooter.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <p class="text">Third-party bike insurance is mandatory under the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988, for riding legally on Indian roads. </p>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <p class="text">Personal Accident Cover for Owner-Driver offers compensation of up to ₹15 lakh in the event of accidental death or permanent disability, as per policy terms.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <p class="text">You can strengthen your coverage with add-on covers such as Zero Depreciation, Roadside Assistance, Consumables Cover, Engine Protection, and more. </p>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <p class="text">Your two-wheeler insurance premium is influenced by factors such as the bike's IDV, make and model, age, engine capacity, location of registration, coverage selected, add-ons opted for, and claim history. </p>
          </li>
           <li class="list-item">
            <p class="text">By maintaining a claim-free record, you can earn a No Claim Bonus (NCB) and enjoy discounts on your two-wheeler insurance renewal premium. </p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content owl-div  bg-pink" id="who-do-you-need">
    <div class="il-container">
      <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Why Do You Need Bike Insurance?</h2>
      <p class="sub-txt color-coolgray align-center width-90">Owning a bike or scooter offers convenience and freedom, but every journey comes with certain risks. From accidents and theft to third-party liabilities, a two-wheeler insurance policy helps protect you from unexpected financial burdens. Here are some key reasons why bike insurance is important:</p>
      <div class="grad-block">
        <div class="grad-sec owl-grad owl-carousel owl-theme  col-wrap">
          <div class="grad-item">
            <div class="ico-block">
              <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/comprehensive_protection.webp" alt="comprehensive_protection" title="comprehensive_protection" class="lazy" width="50">
            </div>
            <div class="grad-cont">
              <h3 class="heading3">Comprehensive Financial Protection</h3>
              <p class="text">A bike insurance policy helps cover expenses arising from accidents, theft, fire, natural calamities, and man-made disasters. Comprehensive coverage can protect your vehicle against a wide range of unforeseen events, helping you avoid significant out-of-pocket costs.</p>
              
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grad-item">
            <div class="ico-block">
              <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/legal_requirement.webp" alt="legal_requirement " title="legal_requirement" class="lazy" width="50">
            </div>
            <div class="grad-cont">
              <h3 class="heading3">Mandatory by Law</h3>
              <p class="text">As per the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988, every two-wheeler must have at least a valid third-party insurance policy to be ridden legally on Indian roads. Having the required insurance coverage helps you stay compliant with the law and avoid penalties.</p>
              
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grad-item">
            <div class="ico-block">
              <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/personal_accident.webp" alt="personal_accident" title="personal_accident" class="lazy" width="50">
            </div>
            <div class="grad-cont">
              <h3 class="heading3">Personal Accident Coverage </h3>
              <p class="text">Road accidents can have serious consequences. Personal Accident Cover for Owner-Driver provides financial support in the event of accidental death or permanent disability, helping safeguard you and your family's financial well-being. </p>
             
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grad-item">
            <div class="ico-block">
              <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/enhanced_coverage.webp" alt="Enhanced Coverage" title="Enhanced Coverage" class="lazy" width="50">
            </div>
            <div class="grad-cont">
              <h3 class="heading3">Enhanced Protection with Add-Ons</h3>
              <p class="text">You can customise your bike insurance policy with add-on covers such as Zero Depreciation Cover, Roadside Assistance, Consumables Cover, Engine Protection, NCB Protection, and more to enjoy broader coverage and greater peace of mind.</p>
           
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content" id="who-should-buy">
    <div class="il-container">
      <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Who Should Buy Two-Wheeler Insurance? </h2>
      <p class="sub-txt color-coolgray align-center mid-width">Two-wheeler insurance is essential for every bike and scooter owner, offering financial protection against accidents, theft, and third-party liabilities.</p>
      <div class="row-block mt-20">
        <div class="row-item">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/new_bike_owners.webp" alt="New Bike Owners" title="New Bike Owners" class="lazy" width="50"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">New Bike Owners </h3>
            <p class="text mt-10">Protect your new bike from day one with comprehensive coverage against damage, theft, and third-party liabilities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-item">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/daily_commuters.webp" alt="Daily Commuters" title="Daily Commuters" class="lazy" width="50"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">Daily Commuters </h3>
            <p class="text mt-10">Frequent road usage increases exposure to risks. Bike insurance helps safeguard you against unexpected expenses.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-item">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/occasional_riders.webp" alt="Occasional Riders" title="Occasional Riders" class="lazy" width="50"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">Occasional Riders  </h3>
            <p class="text mt-10">Even if you ride occasionally, accidents and unforeseen events can happen anytime. Insurance keeps you financially protected.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content bg-gray2 owl-div" id="which-type-of-tw">
    <div class="il-container">
      <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Which Types of Two-Wheelers Can Be Insured with ICICI Lombard?</h2>
      <p class="text sub-txt mt-30 align-center mid-width">ICICI Lombard offers coverage to almost every type of two-wheelers available in the Indian market. You can choose the ideal two-wheeler insurance based on your vehicle and riding style.</p>
      <div class="col-wrap owl-carousel owl-theme owl-sec mt-30">
        <div class="col-item">
          <img alt="Bikes" title="Bikes" class="lazy " data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/bikess.webp" width="290">
          <div class="col-content typesof-tw">
            <h3 class="heading3">Bikes</h3>
            <p class="text color-coolgray mt-10">You can insure all kinds of bike models, be it basic motorcycles or sports bikes. A comprehensive bike insurance will protect your beloved bike against accidents, natural calamities, theft and more.</p>
        
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-item">
          <img alt="Scooters" title="Scooters" class="lazy " data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/scooterss.webp" width="290">
          <div class="col-content typesof-tw">
            <h3 class="heading3 ">Scooters</h3>
            <p class="text color-coolgray mt-10">You can buy <a href="/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/scooter-insurance" class="link" target="_blank">scooter insurance</a> to secure both geared and gearless scooters. Scooters, which are among most popular choices for city travel or daily errands, requires reliable coverage for those everyday road risks. </p>
           
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-item">
          <img alt="Electric Bikes" title="Electric Bikes" class="lazy " data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/electric_bikess.webp" width="290">
          <div class="col-content typesof-tw">
            <h3 class="heading3">Electric Bikes </h3>
            <p class="text color-coolgray mt-10">Electric bikes are gaining popularity for their eco-friendliness. Just like their conventional counterparts, these two-wheelers also require a valid <a href="/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/electric-bike-insurance" class="link" target="_blank">electric bike insurance</a> that protects them against third-party liabilities and own damages. </p>
           
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-item">
          <img alt="Insure Your Moped With ICICI Lombard" title="Insure Your Moped With ICICI Lombard" class="lazy " data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/mopedss.webp" width="290">
          <div class="col-content typesof-tw">
            <h3 class="heading3">Mopeds</h3>
            <p class="text color-coolgray mt-10">These lightweight bikes with 50-100cc engines are a popular choice among small businesses and logistics operators for short-distance commuting and quick deliveries. With their growing presence on the road, these two-wheelers need a reliable bike insurance.</p>
         
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content owl-div" id="Different-Types-of-tw">
    <div class="il-container">
      <h2 class="heading2 align-center">What Are the Different Types of Two-Wheeler Insurance?</h2>
      <div class="option-block owl-block owl-carousel owl-theme col-wrap">
        <div class="option-item">
          <h3 class="heading3">Third-party Two-wheeler Insurance</h3>
          <p class="text">This insurance covers third-party property damages, bodily injuries and even death caused by your insured two-wheeler. It helps cover legal liabilities arising due to such damages. A <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/third-party-bike-insurance" class="link">third-party two-wheeler insurance</a>, which is the most basic form of bike insurance, is mandatory under the Motor Vehicles Act 1988. However, it does not cover damage to your own bike.</p>
          <a href="/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/third-party-bike-insurance" class="primary-btn get-quote-full-btn mt-20" target="_blank">View Plan</a> 
        </div>
        <div class="option-item">
          <h3 class="heading3">Own Damage Two-wheeler Insurance</h3>
          <p class="text">A standalone <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/own-damage-insurance" class="link">own damage two-wheeler insurance</a> protects your bike or scooter against accidental damages, fire, theft, malicious activities, natural calamities, etc. Unlike third-party insurance, this policy focuses on your bike's repair or replacement costs. You can further enhance your own damage coverage with add-ons like zero depreciation, roadside assistance, consumables cover, etc.</p>
          <a href="/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/own-damage-insurance" class="primary-btn get-quote-full-btn mt-20" target="_blank">View Plan </a> 
        </div>
        <div class="option-item">
          <h3 class="heading3">Comprehensive Two-wheeler Insurance</h3>
          <p class="text">A <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/comprehensive-two-wheeler-insurance" class="link">comprehensive two-wheeler insurance</a> or two-wheeler package insurance policy combines a third-party insurance and own damage insurance to offer a 360-degree coverage. In simple terms, it offers coverage for third-party liabilities, own damage, and the damage your bike suffers from accidents, theft, vandalism, etc.</p>
          <a href="/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/comprehensive-two-wheeler-insurance" class="primary-btn get-quote-full-btn mt-20" target="_blank">View Plan </a> 
        </div>
      </div>

   
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content bg-warmgray tab-wrap" id="tw-cover">
    <div class="il-container">
      <h2 class="heading2 align-center inclusive-head">What is Covered by ICICI Lombard Two-Wheeler Insurance?</h2>
       <h2 class="heading2 align-center exclusive-head" style="display:none;">What is Not Covered by ICICI Lombard Two-Wheeler Insurance?</h2>

      
      <p class="sub-txt align-center mid-width inclusive-para width-80">ICICI Lombard offers comprehensive protection against a range of common and unexpected risks that riders face on Indian roads. Here’s a glimpse into what’s covered by our Two-wheeler Vehicle Package Policy: </p>

       <p class="sub-txt align-center mid-width exclusive-para width-80" style="display:none;">While ICICI Lombard offers wide coverage, our Two-wheeler Vehicle Package Policy does not cover certain losses and situations. These include:</p>

      <div class="tab-block">
        <div class="tab-sec">
          <ul>
            <li class="active" data-rel="inclusion"><span>What’s Covered </span></li>
            <li data-rel="exclusion" class=""><span>What’s Not Covered </span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-data">
          <div class="tab-cont active read-more-option" id="inclusion">
            <ul class="list-block check-list2 grid-list">
              <li class="flex-list">
                <h4 class="heading4">Accidents</h4>
                <p class="text">Our bike insurance policy covers damages or losses caused to your bike due to a road accident, collision, etc. With this, you don’t have to worry about repair or replacement costs!</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list">
                <h4 class="heading4">Theft</h4>
                <p class="text">We also provide compensation in case your bike is stolen. This compensation is based on your vehicle’s Insured Declared Value (IDV) and policy terms and conditions.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list">
                <h4 class="heading4">Fire</h4>
                <p class="text"> Your bike is also covered against damages or losses caused to your bike by fire explosion, self-ignition, lightning, etc.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list">
                <h4 class="heading4">Natural Calamities</h4>
                <p class="text">Our bike insurance policy covers losses or damages suffered by your two-wheeler due to lightning, earthquakes, typhoons, frost, landslides, etc.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list more-option-show">
                <h4 class="heading4">Man-made disasters</h4>
                <p class="text">Our two-wheeler insurance provides coverage against riots, strikes, malicious acts, terrorist activities, etc.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list more-option-show">
                <h4 class="heading4">Personal Accidents</h4>
                <p class="text">We offer a Personal Accident Cover of up to ₹15 lakh for the two-wheeler owner. You can also buy this cover for your co-passenger with an additional premium. </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list more-option-show">
                <h4 class="heading4">Third-party Legal Liability</h4>
                <p class="text">Our bike insurance policy offers protection against third-party legal liability for accidents and damages caused by your bike.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list more-option-show">
                <h4 class="heading4">Transit-related Damages</h4>
                <p class="text">We also cover damages sustained by your bike during transit by road, rail, inland-waterway, lift, or air.</p>
              </li>
             
            </ul>
              <a href="javascript:;" class="read-more-opt-btn">Read more</a>
             <p class="note-txt">Note: Refer to <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/downloads" class="link" target="_blank">policy wording</a> for detailed information on inclusions. </p>
          </div>
          <div class="tab-cont read-more-option" id="exclusion">
            <ul class="list-block cross-list grid-list">
              <li class="flex-list">
                <h4 class="heading4">Loss/Damage Outside Geographical Area</h4>
                <p class="text">Our bike insurance policy doesn’t cover any accidental losses or damages incurred outside India.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list">
                <h4 class="heading4">Depreciation</h4>
                <p class="text">We do not cover replacement or repair costs incurred due to general wear and tear and/or depreciation of different bike parts. </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list">
                <h4 class="heading4">Contractual Liability</h4>
                <p class="text">Our two-wheeler insurance does not cover any liability assumed under a private agreement or contract that’s specifically excluded from the policy.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list more-option-show">
                <h4 class="heading4">Illegal Driving</h4>
                <p class="text">We do not cover any accidental damages when the insured is riding their vehicle under the influence of drugs/liquor or without a valid driving licence.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex-list more-option-show">
                <h4 class="heading4">War-like Situations</h4>
                <p class="text">Bike insurance plans do not cover damages resulting from war, invasion, nuclear risks, civil war, mutiny, rebellion, etc.</p>
              </li>
              
            </ul>

            <a href="javascript:;" class="read-more-opt-btn">Read more</a>
             <p class="note-txt">Note: Refer to <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/downloads" class="link" target="_blank">policy wording</a> for detailed information on exclusions. </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      
       
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

