  <section class="section-content bg-pink" id="Compare-tw-premium">
    <div class="il-container">
      <div class="cont-list-block flex-div">
        <div class="cont-block left-block">
          <h2 class="heading2">How to Effectively Compare Bike Insurance Premium?</h2>
          <p class="text mt-15 mb-15">Comparing bike insurance premiums online isn’t about choosing the lowest price. It’s about getting the right coverage at the right value. Here are some tips to effectively compare your bike insurance premium:</p>
        </div>
        <div class="list-block org-list right-block">
          <ul>
            <li class="text"><strong>Compare Plans Online: </strong> The first step is comparing bike insurance plans online. A third-party coverage is cheaper, but a comprehensive bike insurance covers both third-party liabilities and own damage.</li>
            <li class="text"><strong>Check IDV: </strong> Pay special attention to IDVs offered across different bike insurance quotes. A lower IDV reduces premium but also lowers your claim payout in case of theft or total loss.</li>
            <li class="text"><strong>Review Coverage Details: </strong> Carefully go through the policy inclusions and exclusions to understand what’s covered and what’s not covered. Some policies may appear cheaper but offer limited benefits.</li>
            <li class="text"><strong>Evaluate Add-ons: </strong> There are multiple add-on options available in the market to improve your bike insurance coverage. However, they attract additional premium. Evaluate your needs and select the ones that actually add value to your coverage.</li>
            <li class="text"><strong>Compare Deductibles:</strong> Opting for a higher voluntary deductible lowers your payable premium but increases your out-of-pocket expense during a bike insurance claim.</li>
            <li class="text"><strong>Review Premium Break-Up: </strong> Your premium is made up of multiple components like your own damage premium, your third-party liability premium, add-on premium, personal accident coverage premium, etc. Review your premium break-up before selecting a policy.</li>
          </ul>
          <!-- <p class="text mt-20">You can also use a health insurance calculator to get a fair idea about your payable medical insurance premium.</p> -->
          <!-- <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance/health-insurance-premium-calculator" class="primary-btn buy-now-btn calc-prem-btn full-btn-width" target="_blank">Calculate Premium Now</a> -->
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

