  <section class="section-content  bg-warmgray" id="How-to-File-tw-ins-claim">
    <div class="il-container">
      <h2 class="heading2 align-center">How to File a Two-Wheeler Insurance Claim Online?</h2>
      <p class="sub-txt align-center">Filing a two-wheeler insurance claim is quick and simple. Just follow these steps:</p>
      <div class="row-block   mt-20  claim-online-wrapper owl-block owl-carousel owl-theme col-wrap">
        <div class="row-item bg-white">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/inform_us.webp" alt="Inform us" title="Inform us" class="lazy" width="50"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">Inform us</h3>
            <p class="text mt-10">Intimate ICICI Lombard about the damage, theft or loss as soon as possible after the incident. You can do this online via our <a target="_blank" class="link" href="/motor-insurance-claims#/claimOptions"> website</a> , through the IL TakeCare app, by calling the toll-free number 1800 2666 or contacting us on WhatsApp: 7738282666.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-item bg-white">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/complete_video_survey.webp" alt="Complete Video Survey" title="Complete Video Survey" class="lazy" width="50"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">Complete Video Survey </h3>
            <p class="text mt-10">  Log into our IL TakeCare App and complete your video survey using the InstaSpect# option.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-item bg-white">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/submit_documents.webp" alt="Submit Documents" title="Submit Documents" class="lazy" width="50"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">Submit Documents </h3>
            <p class="text mt-10">Upload or submit essential documents such as your bike registration certificate (RC), driving licence, filled claim form and FIR (for theft cases).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-item bg-white">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/track_your_claim.webp" alt="Track Your Claim" title="Track Your Claim" class="lazy" width="50"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">Track Your Claim</h3>
            <p class="text mt-10"> You can check the status of your bike insurance claim on our website or WhatsApp or via the IL TakeCare app using your policy number and registered mobile number.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
      <p class="text align-center mt-20 note-text"> Note: In case of queries, read more details about <a href="/motor-insurance-claims#/claimOptions" target="_blank" class="link">how to file a claim</a>.</p>
    </div> 
  </section>

  <section class="section-content" id="doc-require-claim">
    <div class="il-container">
      <div class="cont-img-block flex-div">
         <div class="img-block">
          <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/documents_requireds.webp" alt="Documents Required for Filing a Bike Insurance Claim" title="Documents Required for Filing a Bike Insurance Claim" class="img-hide lazy" width="450">
        </div>
        <div class="cont-block width-50">
          <h2 class="heading2">Documents Required for Filing a Bike Insurance Claim</h2>
          <p class="text mt-10 doc-txt-para">You need to submit certain documents while filing a bike insurance claim with ICICI Lombard. Submitting the right documents will make the process faster and smoother. Here’s a list of documents you will need while filling a bike insurance claim:
</p>
          <div class="list-block org-list mt-20">
            <ul>
              <!-- <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Policy Documents </span>A copy of your active bike insurance policy to
                verify coverage details.</li> -->
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Identification Proofs:  </span>Certified copy of one officially valid document
                &amp; PAN card/form 60.</li>
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Claim Form:  </span>A duly filled and signed claim form with NEFT mandate
                form/cancelled cheque.</li>
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Registration Certificate (RC):  </span>Your bike’s valid RC to confirm
                ownership.</li>
            
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Driving Licence:  </span>A copy of the licence of the rider driving at the
                time of the incident.</li>
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">FIR/Police Report: </span>This is mandatory for theft claims or if a third
                party is involved.</li>
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Repair Bills and Invoices:  </span>Original garage estimate and final repair
                bills.</li>
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Form 28/29/30:  </span>These are required in case of total loss or salvage
                situations.</li>
              <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">No Objection Certificate (NOC): </span>Needed if the bike is under loan or
                finance</li>
            
            </ul>
          </div>
          <p class="text mt-30"><span class="strong-txt">Note: </span>Check the full list of <a target="_blank" class="link" href="/docs/default-source/default-document-library/motor-odpt-claims-document-checklist.pdf">documents</a>.</p>
        </div>
       
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content bg-sec-blue" id="renew-tw">
    <div class="il-container">
      <div class="cont-img-block flex-div">
        <div class="cont-block width-50">
          <h2 class="heading2">How to Renew a Two-Wheeler Insurance Policy?</h2>
          <p class="text mt-20">You can easily renew your bike insurance online in a few clicks. Renewing your bike insurance policy on time helps you avoid any lapse in coverage and protects your accumulated NCB benefits.
To renew your policy, all you need to do is:</p>
          <div class="series-block series-style1 mt-30">
            <div class="series-item">
              <div class="series-no">1</div>
              <p class="series-txt"><span class="strong-txt">Visit Our Website/App: </span> Visit our <a class="link" target="_blank" href="https://www.icicilombard.com/motor-insurance/two-wheeler-insurance/renewal/">website</a>  or log in to our IL TakeCare App and select the “Renew” option.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="series-item">
              <div class="series-no">2</div>
               <p class="series-txt"><span class="strong-txt">Enter Details: </span> Fill in the required details, including your vehicle number, existing policy details, etc.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="series-item">
              <div class="series-no">3</div>
               <p class="series-txt"><span class="strong-txt">Review Coverage Details: </span> Check your existing coverage, IDV and add-ons. Make changes if needed. Select NCB, if applicable.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="series-item">
              <div class="series-no">4</div>
               <p class="series-txt"><span class="strong-txt">Make Payment: </span> Make the required payment online to renew your policy.</p>
            </div>
           
          </div>
          <p class="text mt-20">Note that you can also renew your lapsed/expired two-wheeler insurance policy online. However, you may need to complete an inspection before renewal due to a break in coverage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="img-block">
          <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-tw-revamp/how_to_renews.webp" alt="Steps To Renew Bike Insurance Online" title="How To Renew Two Wheeler Insurance Online" class="img-para-block lazy" width="450">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-content linear-red-bg" id="avoid-fines">
        <div class="il-container">
            <div class="mid-wrap">
