</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><section class="section-content bg-coolgray tab-accord-sec" id="faq-sec">
    <div class="il-container">
        <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Frequently Asked Questions on Two Wheeler Insurance</h2>

        <div class="tab-sec">
            <ul>
                <li class="active" id="general"><span>General</span></li>
                <li id="coverage"><span>Coverage</span></li>
                <li id="premium" class=""><span>Premium</span></li>
                <li id="claims" class=""><span>Claims</span></li>
                <li id="renewal" class=""><span>Renewal</span></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-wrap">
            <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="general">
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How to buy a bike insurance online?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">It is easy to buy bike insurance online if you have your vehicle registration number. You can buy ICICI Lombard two-wheeler insurance from our website or IL TakeCare app via the following steps:</p>

                        <div class="list-block arrow-list faq">
                            <ul class="mt-15">
                                <li class="text mb-10">Enter the vehicle registration number and your contact details</li>
                                <li class="text mb-10">Review instant quote received for your motor insurance policy based on your vehicle type </li>
                                <li class="text mb-10">Pay the premium if you’re happy with the quote</li>
                                <li class="text mb-10">View and download the policy instantly online.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <p>When you buy vehicle insurance online, remember to look for add-on features that suit your needs.</p>
                    </div>
                     
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What are the documents required to buy a bike insurance online?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">You don’t need to provide any documents while buying bike insurance online. Just share your bike registration number, your contact details and complete your KYC. Typically, renewals also do not require you to submit any documents. All you need to do is provide us with the right details about your bike and the existing policy. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                  <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What happens if traffic police catch me without valid bike insurance?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Riding a vehicle without valid third-party insurance can attract a fine of Rs.2,000 or more as per the Motor Vehicles Act.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Once the break-in inspection request is raised online, how long does it take to get the policy?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Once you raise a request, the inspection will happen within 48 hours. Once the inspection is complete, you will receive your policy immediately.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                  <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is bike insurance mandatory for old two-wheelers as well?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, a third-party insurance is mandatory for all bikes regardless of their age.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I buy bike insurance for a second-hand bike?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you can buy bike insurance online for a second-hand bike after transferring ownership in your name.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I insure a bike registered in another state?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you can but inform the insurance company about the registration details and usage location.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is bike insurance required if the bike is not in use?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you need at least a third-party bike insurance even if the bike is not in use.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can bike insurance be in someone else's name?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">No, the bike insurance policy should be in the registered owner’s name.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How to check bike insurance status?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">You can check details about your bike insurance online via your insurer website, policy document or the VAHAN portal using registration number.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is bike insurance transferable when ownership changes?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, it is.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What happens if I ride someone else’s bike and meet with an accident?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">It depends on your coverage type and whether you have a valid bike insurance policy at the time of the accident.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="coverage">
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How is the Insured Declared Value (IDV) of my vehicle decided and how does it impact my coverage?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">The IDV is based on your bike’s current market value after depreciation. It determines the maximum payout in case of total loss or theft.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does bike insurance cover damages due to floods or cyclones?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, own damage bike insurance and comprehensive bike insurance covers damages due to floods or cyclones.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Are accidents caused due to drunk driving covered?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">No. Bike insurance does not cover accidents caused due to riding under the influence of alcohol or drugs. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does bike insurance cover damages due to wear and tear?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">No, bike insurance does not cover damages arising from normal wear and tear.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is engine damage due to water ingress covered?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Bike insurance covers engine damage due to water ingress only if you have the Engine Protect Plus add-on.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does bike insurance cover accidents outside my city or state?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, it does.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Are tyres and tubes covered under bike insurance?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, if your bike tyres and/or tubes were damaged in an accident (subject to depreciation).</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Are damages caused during racing or stunts covered?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">No, bike insurance does not cover damages caused during racing or stunts.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What are the turnaround times (TAT) for my insurance services?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Policy issuance is usually instant. However, the <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/docs/default-source/default-document-library/claims-tat-(general-insurance).pdf" target="_blank" class="link">claims TAT</a> depend on survey assessment, documents submitted and policy terms and conditions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">In case I change my job and location, what happens to my bike insurance policy?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Your bike insurance policy remains valid, no matter where you shift in the country. Just inform us if you permanently move to another city or RTO zone.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I have more than one bike insurance policy for the same bike?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">No, you cannot have two bike insurance policies with the same coverage type for one bike at the same time.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
              
            </div>

            <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="premium">
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How is motor insurance premium calculated?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Your bike insurance premium is calculated based on your vehicle’s IDV, age, engine CC, location, NCB and add-ons.</p>
                        <app-faq-premium-calculate></app-faq-premium-calculate>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does the bike insurance premium increase every year?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Your bike insurance premium may change due to IDV reduction, claim history or regulatory revisions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does installing an anti-theft device reduce premium?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you get a discount on your bike insurance premium for installing approved anti-theft devices.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is GST included in bike insurance premium?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, an 18% GST is currently applicable on bike insurance premium.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does modifying the bike increase premium?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, certain bike modifications can increase your bike insurance premium.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is a third-party bike insurance cheaper than comprehensive insurance?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, but it offers limited coverage compared to a comprehensive bike insurance.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>

            <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="claims">
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is FIR mandatory for all bike insurance claims?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">An FIR is mandatory for claims related to theft and major third-party injuries/damages.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I file an insurance claim for minor scratches or dents?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you can but it may affect your NCB.</p>
                       
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is there a time window for filing a claim?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">It is advisable to file a bike insurance claim as soon as possible after the incident.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I track my bike insurance claim status online?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">You can track the status of your bike insurance claim online via our website or IL TakeCare App or WhatsApp: 7738282666.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I claim insurance if repairs are done outside network garage?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you can file for a reimbursement. Just follow the details mentioned on our <a href="/motor-insurance-claims#/claimOptions" target="_blank" class="link">bike insurance claims page</a>.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                 <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How many claims can I make in a year?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Typically, you can file multiple claims but frequent claims can affect your NCB and claim history. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                  <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What happens to my NCB after a claim?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Your NCB resets to zero if you make a bike insurance claim unless you have the NCB Protect add-on.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                  <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What criteria is considered to classify my insured vehicle as a Total Loss, Constructive Total Loss, or Cash Loss?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">An insurer considers a vehicle as Constructive Total Loss when the total cost of repair or retrieval exceeds 75% of the bike’s IDV. Meanwhile, Total Loss applies when damage is beyond repair while Cash Loss refers to a negotiated settlement.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!--<div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is the compulsory deductible that will be applicable to my policy?</h3>
