            </div>

            <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="renewal">
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What happens if I miss my bike insurance renewal date?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Your bike insurance policy may lapse, and your bike may be required to undergo inspection before coverage is reinstated.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is there a grace period for the bike insurance renewal?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">It depends on the insurance company.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I renew bike insurance after a long lapse?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you can renew your bike insurance after a policy lapse subject to inspection and underwriting approval.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is vehicle inspection required after policy expiry?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, some insurers may require vehicle inspection after bike insurance expiry/lapse. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Will I lose NCB if policy lapses?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you will lose your accumulated NCB if you don’t renew your bike insurance policy on time. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I switch insurer while renewing bike insurance?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you can easily port your bike insurance policy to another insurer at the time of renewal. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accord-row">
                    <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I upgrade coverage during renewal?</h3>
                    <div class="accord-data mt-5">
                        <p class="text">Yes, you can modify your IDV and opt for add-ons for enhanced coverage during renewal. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

