    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "It is easy to buy bike insurance online if you have your vehicle registration number. You can buy ICICI Lombard two-wheeler insurance from our website or IL TakeCare app via the following steps:

Enter the vehicle registration number and your contact details
Review instant quote received for your motor insurance policy based on your vehicle type
Pay the premium if you’re happy with the quote
View and download the policy instantly online.
When you buy vehicle insurance online, remember to look for add-on features that suit your needs."
    }
  },{
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "What are the documents required to buy a bike insurance online?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "You don’t need to provide any documents while buying bike insurance online. Just share your bike registration number, your contact details and complete your KYC. Typically, renewals also do not require you to submit any documents. All you need to do is provide us with the right details about your bike and the existing policy."
    }
  },{
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "What happens if traffic police catch me without valid bike insurance?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Riding a vehicle without valid third-party insurance can attract a fine of Rs.2,000 or more as per the Motor Vehicles Act."
    }
  },{
    "@type": "Question",
